    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, there are no tiny ways to fix this. it's not like i can do the dishes or something to make up for the fact that she's basically sacrificing her entire future for me. it's a fundamental thing. i'm just a sinkhole for her time and money. honestly, sometimes i look at her and think it would be more compassionate if i just wasn't a factor anymore. like, wouldn't she be better off if she didn't have to deal with me at all?",
